TY  - JOUR
TI  - Performance-Improved Highly Integrated Uniaxial Tristate Hybrid Nanogenerator for Sustainable Mechanical Energy Harvesting.
AU  - A. A. Khan
AU  - Resul Saritas
AU  - M. Rana
AU  - N. Tanguy
AU  - Weiguang Zhu
AU  - Nanqin Mei
AU  - Sathursan Kokilathasan
AU  - S. Rassel
